    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Channel Cosmic Forces of Order</p></blockquote><p>The cosmic force of order has suffused you with magic. That power arises from Mechanus or a similar realm, a plane of existence shaped entirely by clockwork efficiency. You or someone of your lineage might have become entangled in the machinations of the modrons, the orderly beings who inhabit Mechanus; perhaps your ancestor even took part in the Great Modron March. Whatever its origin, the power of order can seem strange to others, but for you it is part of a vast and glorious system.</p><h3>Clockwork Sorcery Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.FhEodhzsOIhacHUQ]{Clockwork Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.fEmunX2uPa7PBcag]{Restore Balance}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.2SlP06JR0DKypRqp]{Bastion of Law}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.yEWPkgLt9qZ2SDvl]{Trance of Order}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.UeSKUAgXloQD6xuZ]{Clockwork Cavalcade}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Clockwork Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Sorcerer Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAid0000000]{Aid}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAlarm00000]{Alarm}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLesserRest]{Lesser Restoration}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbEvilAndGoodPr]{Protection from Evil and Good}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDispelMagi]{Dispel Magic}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbProtectionFro]{Protection from Energy}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFreedomofM]{Freedom of Movement}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.dcVRJ03J6bHYUfOd]{Summon Construct}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterRes]{Greater Restoration}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWallofForc]{Wall of Force}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
